#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:137
msgid ""
"The ``--run_name`` argument is used to specify the name of the run. This is "
"used to create a directory for the run in the ``logs/rsl_rl/cartpole`` "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"``--run_name`` 参数用于指定运行的名称。这用于在 ``logs/rsl_rl/cartpole`` 目录中为运行创建一个目录。"

#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:140
msgid ""
"When continuing RSL-RL training with a different policy learning rate, use "
"``--checkpoint /path/to/model.pt --no-resume_optimizer_state``. This "
"restores model weights and the iteration count while keeping the newly "
"configured policy optimizer and its learning rate. By default, "
"``--resume_optimizer_state`` restores the checkpoint's optimizer state as "
"usual. RND models and their separate optimizer retain their checkpoint "
"state. For distillation, this option requires a student checkpoint "
"containing both student and teacher; omit it when initializing a new student"
" from a PPO teacher checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"继续 RSL-RL 训练时，如果需要修改策略学习率，可使用 ``--checkpoint /path/to/model.pt --no-"
"resume_optimizer_state``。它会恢复模型权重和迭代次数，但保留新配置的策略优化器及其学习率。默认的 "
"``--resume_optimizer_state`` 则照常恢复检查点中的优化器状态。RND "
"模型及其独立优化器仍会恢复检查点状态。蒸馏时，此选项要求学生检查点同时包含学生和教师；从 PPO 教师检查点初始化新学生时，应省略此选项。"

#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:148
msgid ""
"Installed downstream tasks are discovered through the ``isaaclab.tasks`` "
"entry-point group. Custom launchers can call "
"``isaaclab.cli.load_external_tasks()`` before looking up task IDs, as the "
"built-in CLI and direct RL workers do."
msgstr ""
"已安装的下游任务通过 ``isaaclab.tasks`` 入口点组发现。自定义启动器可像内置 CLI 和直接运行的强化学习工作进程一样，在查询任务 "
"ID 前调用 ``isaaclab.cli.load_external_tasks()``。"
